{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zxzdUOTLTO1794324798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市回軟，三大指數全線下跌。</p><p></p><p>美國上月通脹表現高過預期，市場對加息預期升溫。道指早段曾跌逾370點，跌至52,000點邊緣。納指失守25,000點水平，曾跌近300點。</p><p></p><p>上日急挫的輝達，再跌約百分之3。美光科技和閃迪則靠穩，升幅不足百分之1。AMD造好，早段升約半成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:44:13.189083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T15:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:52:27.590322+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:37:25.146872+00:00","content_hash":"2c9886fb025b6985d2f4332e265b69a14d1c92d51983f4d4f4d06b47cf32a10c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:44:13.189083+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}